notify.code.body.t:
Your code for {purpose} is {code}.
It is valid for {minutes} minutes. Do not share it with anyone: the help desk will never ask for it.

{company}

notify.methodAdded.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
a new verification method was registered on your account {user}: {method}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.methodRemoved.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
the verification method {method} was removed from your account {user}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.passwordChanged.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
the password of your account {user} was changed on {time}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.passwordReset.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
the password of your account {user} was reset from the portal on {time}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.accountUnlocked.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
your account {user} was unlocked from the portal on {time}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.adminUnlock.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
your account {user} was unlocked by the help desk on {time}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.adminClearEnrollment.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
the help desk cleared the verification methods of your account {user}: register them again at {portalUrl}. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}

notify.adminTemporaryReset.body.t:
Hello {displayName},
the help desk set a temporary password on your account {user}: you will have to change it at the next sign-in. If this wasn't you, contact the help desk immediately ({helpdesk}).

{company}
